The following code worked for me, to download multiple PDF files created by the app as a single ZIP file -

# Download plots
  output$download_plots = downloadHandler(
    filename = function() "plots.zip",
    content = function(file) {
      setwd(tmpdir)
      zip(
        file,
        list.files(".", "^group.\\.pdf")
      )
    },
    contentType = "application/zip"
  )

